for Vehicles > Tires and Wheels > Automobile Tires', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rcel-lrsou5gzusxtd2', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F882691919%2F23792844116', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
