re Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Air Conditioning', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-821ge-mgqkh9exn66j2e', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1528132983%2F58250395667', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
