 Zinco Quelatado 5,00mg; Selênio 0,30mg; Selênio Complexado 0,01mg; Proteinato de manganês 1,50mg Fornecedor: Adimax Industria e Comercio', 93.37, 93.37, NULL, 'Pets > Pet Accessories > Others', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-824it-mpia2vnvzmkv8d', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F822103155%2F58209537863', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
